# Minesweeper: About (SHELL.DLL's box), Color off (the monochrome bitmaps), Marks off, the Game menu,
# Exit. Same keys as e.scn, run on real 3.11 as arch311-ref/scn/winmine-e.scn. In the About box the
# licensed user (the Linux account here, Setup's name there) and the memory figures differ on purpose.
# regress: sh apps/winmine/tests/run.sh "$TEST" "$OUT"
# compare: winmine-e/02.png 01.png ignore 320 240 332 260 ignore 196 218 340 234 ignore 326 322 450 354
# compare: winmine-e/03.png 02.png ignore 320 240 332 260
# compare: winmine-e/04.png 03.png ignore 320 240 332 260
# ini: WINMINE.INI Minesweeper Mark=0
# ini: WINMINE.INI Minesweeper Color=0
# ini: WINMINE.INI Minesweeper Difficulty=0
# ini: WINMINE.INI Minesweeper Name3=Anonymous
sleep 400
key alt
key h
key a
sleep 400
shot shots/01.png
key enter
key alt
key g
key l
sleep 400
shot shots/02.png
key alt
key g
key m
key alt
key g
sleep 400
shot shots/03.png
key esc
key esc
key alt
key g
key x
quit
